+// MockQueryM2MWithCtx support QueryM2MWithCtx and QueryM2M
+// Now you may be need to use golang/mock to generate QueryM2M mock instance
+// Or use DoNothingQueryM2Mer
+// for example:
+// 	post := Post{Id: 4}
